/* Phrases à trou (%@ = adresse ou nom) */
"Parallel TCP connections will be established to %@ on TCP ports from 1 to 65535, to find open services. The new discovered services will be displayed on the bottom view. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "將在 TCP 連接埠 1 至 65535 上與 %@ 建立平行 TCP 連線，以尋找開放的服務。新偵測到的服務會顯示在下方視圖中。按下 STOP 按鈕可中斷此工作。";
"A TCP connection to the Discard port (9/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be sent on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device to this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the outgoing direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "將與 %@ 的 Discard 連接埠（9/TCP）建立 TCP 連線。接著，本裝置會透過此連線以可用的最大傳輸量向該目標主機傳送資料，以評估上傳方向可達到的最大速度。按下 STOP 按鈕可中斷此工作。";
"A TCP connection to the Chargen port (19/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be received on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device from this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the incoming direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "將與 %@ 的 Chargen 連接埠（19/TCP）建立 TCP 連線。接著，本裝置會透過此連線以可用的最大傳輸量從該目標主機接收資料，以評估下載方向可達到的最大速度。按下 STOP 按鈕可中斷此工作。";
"ICMP packets of type ECHO_REQUEST will be sent to %@ at a rate of one packet per second. The target should reply with an ICMP packet of type ECHO_REPLY. The round trip type is computed and displayed on the chart. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "將以每秒一個封包的速率向 %@ 傳送 ECHO_REQUEST 類型的 ICMP 封包。目標應以 ECHO_REPLY 類型的 ICMP 封包回覆。往返時間會經過計算並顯示在圖表上。按下 STOP 按鈕可中斷此工作。";
"found %@" = "已找到 %@";
"trying %@" = "正在嘗試 %@";
"retrying %@" = "正在重試 %@";
